@dataclass(kw_only=True)
class PublicationEventType:
    """
    To describe when, where, in which formats and under which rights
    conditions the resource has been distributed.

    Parameters
    ----------
    publication_date
        The first publication date
    publication_time
        The publication time
    publication_duration
        The publication duration
    schedule_date
        To indicate the schedule date, which can differ from the actual
        publicationDate if it occurs after midnight of the schedule date
    publication_service
        The service to which the channel is attached
    publication_medium
        To provide information on the medium used to distribute the
        resource.
    publication_channel
        To identify the channel through which the resource has been
        distributed.
    publication_region
        To identify the region where the resource has been distributed.
    related_publication_event
        To list publication events related to the current publication event
    publication_event_id
        To uniquely identify a pèublication event.
    publication_event_name
        To provide a human readable name for a publication event.
    first_showing
        A flag indicating if the resource was first shown during this
        publication event.
    last_showing
        A flag indicating if the resource was last shown during this
        publication event.
    live
        A flag indicating if the resource is shown live during this
        publication event. Production and transmission are live.
    live_production
        A flag indicating if the resource was captured live for this
        publication event. Transmission is not live (see live flag). Content
        is recorded.
    free
        A flag indicating if the resource was shown with or wothout access
        restrictions during this publication event.
    note
        A note to provide additional contextual information.
    format_id_ref
        to identify the format in which content has been published
    rights_idrefs
        to identify all the rights associated with the publication event
    """

